---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Schedule | Trajectory CoPilot" description="Semester schedule for the Trajectory CoPilot project.">
  <script is:inline>
    const PASSWORD = 'schedule me';
    window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      const gate = document.querySelector('[data-gate]');
      const form = document.querySelector('[data-password-form]');
      const input = document.querySelector('[data-password-input]');
      const error = document.querySelector('[data-password-error]');
      const content = document.querySelector('[data-protected-content]');
      if (!gate || !form || !input || !error || !content) return;

      const unlock = () => {
        gate.classList.add('hidden');
        content.classList.remove('hidden');
      };

      const lock = () => {
        gate.classList.remove('hidden');
        content.classList.add('hidden');
        input.value = '';
      };

      lock();

      form.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
        event.preventDefault();
        if (input.value.trim().toLowerCase() === PASSWORD) {
          unlock();
          error.textContent = '';
        } else {
          error.textContent = 'Incorrect password. Try again.';
        }
      });
    });
  </script>

  <section class="space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-orbital">Project schedule</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Trajectory CoPilot Schedule</h1>
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-slate-300">
        Enter the password to view the proposed semester plan for building, testing, and validating the trajectory copilot.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div data-gate class="card max-w-xl space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Password required</h2>
      <form data-password-form class="space-y-4">
        <label class="block text-sm text-slate-300" for="schedule-password">Type the password to continue</label>
        <input id="schedule-password" data-password-input type="password" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/30 px-4 py-3 text-white outline-none ring-0 placeholder:text-slate-500 focus:border-orbital" placeholder="Enter password" />
        <button class="rounded-full bg-orbital px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:opacity-90" type="submit">Unlock schedule</button>
        <p data-password-error class="text-sm text-thruster"></p>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div data-protected-content class="hidden space-y-8">
      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="card space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Week 1</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Finalize the project scope, one-pager, and success criteria.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Week 2</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Gather benchmark problems from Professor Miller's orbital dynamics material and organize reference solutions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Week 3</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Test the agent on two-body astrodynamics and Clohessy-Wiltshire rendezvous problems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Week 4</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Start one-orbit and two-burn rendezvous tests and document transfer-time versus delta-V tradeoffs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Week 5</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Set up GMAT verification workflows and compare agent results against analytical and numerical checks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Week 6</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Identify when assumptions fail and determine what information was missing from the prompt or scenario.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Weeks 7–8</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Refine prompt structure, validation steps, and the agent's ability to explain its reasoning.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Weeks 9–10</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Move to harder rendezvous or cislunar scenarios and compare the agent’s workflow with human problem solving.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Weeks 11–12</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Synthesize results into patterns showing where the agent helps, where it fails, and how to improve prompts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Weeks 13–14</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300">Finish the site, finalize documentation, and prepare the final presentation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Weekly rhythm</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300">
          <li>Early week: extend the benchmark set or write a new scenario</li>
          <li>Midweek: run the agent and verify outputs with GMAT or Python</li>
          <li>Late week: record failure modes, missing assumptions, and next steps</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
